---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Thank you · Mental Note" description="Your note was received.">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Got it</div>
  <h1>Thank you for writing.</h1>
  <p class="lead">One of us reads every note before anything goes up — usually within a day. Yours is anonymous, and it isn't linked to anything else.</p>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:48px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="acts">
    <a class="b1 dk" href="/this-week">Write another</a>
    <a class="b2" href="/articles">Read something →</a>
  </div>
  <p class="cnt2" style="margin-top:40px">If you're struggling right now, a note isn't help — call or text <b>988</b>, or text HOME to <b>741741</b>. That's a real person, right now.</p>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
